OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government to hold
OL,4,AWales-specific Covid inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government is to push on with
OL,7,Fplans for an independent Wales Covid-19
OL,8,Freview.
OL,10,FPlaid Cymru promised in its Senedd
OL,11,Felection manifesto that, if it won, it
OL,12,Fwould examine the Labour
OL,13,Fadministration's handling of the
OL,14,Fpandemic.
OL,16,FCovid Bereaved Families for Justice
OL,17,FCymru, which represents people who lost
OL,18,Floved ones, has long called for a Welsh
OL,19,Finquiry.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
